Subject: [PATCH 0571/1695] dts: stm32: force v5v_vconn always on for
 stm32mp257f-dk

Workaround to allow M33 firmware development for USB UCPD

Need to be reverted with support of
* Ticket 147183 - MP25, add SCMI client in CM33 FW, USB UCPD need SCMI
  service to enable its power supplies

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git eb0ce0780ac676650cbc46f2d18b85f260a7b0ff dts: stm32: force v5v_vconn always on for stm32mp257f-dk]
