Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/344912
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Gatien CHEVALLIER <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp257f-dk.dts | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp257f-dk.dts b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp257f-dk.dts
index 019d9832a..b8ee298d2 100644
